# Scratch workspace for subagent-driven development runs: briefs, reports and
# review diffs. Never part of the repository. The skill drops its own ignore
# file inside .superpowers/sdd/, but that only covers that one subdirectory and
# disappears with it — this rule covers the whole tree, which matters because
# the delegator subagents commit with `git add -A`.
.superpowers/
